                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0872192f-60ec-3a4f-8cc0-3af0da483515",
                        "entry_id": "2ae15cc2-7a4e-3e43-ac9d-87048c0bb642",
                        "glosses": [
                            "геол. характерый для коллектора, либо имеющий иное непосредственное отношение к такому специалисту или его работе - сбору, занесению в опись и хранению геологических образцов. Определение возраста, литологии, коллекторских свойств горных пород и наличия в разрезе нефти."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4f28af2f-3dfd-3cab-ac43-6e43495e0698",
                        "entry_id": "2ae15cc2-7a4e-3e43-ac9d-87048c0bb642",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спец. специализирующийся на взыскании задолженности либо имеющий к этой сфере деятельности иное непосредственное отношение. Во всем мире проблему взыскания просроченной задолженности давно и успешно решают специализированные коллекторские агентства."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fd7558c4-a8e7-48c1-b3e3-b6c924f8fa24",
                        "source_entry_id": "2ae15cc2-7a4e-3e43-ac9d-87048c0bb642",
                        "source_sense_description": "геол.",
                        "target_lang_word": "collector",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "collector",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f67c9ca0-3686-3e7c-b9ef-0a0ad516e133",
                                        "entry_id": "89674fca-284a-38d1-92e9-ee07bc695211",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who or thing that collects, or which creates or manages a collection."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f62e92e9-b539-42bc-8fb4-1195c6d44525",
                                                "sense_id": "f67c9ca0-3686-3e7c-b9ef-0a0ad516e133",
                                                "text": "She is an avid collector of nineteenth-century postage stamps."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "948c303c-cdfd-408e-a5ad-d06167897207",
                                                "sense_id": "f67c9ca0-3686-3e7c-b9ef-0a0ad516e133",
                                                "text": "That old piano is just a big dust collector."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12bbb4b3-da20-47e5-9074-f4def55054da",
                                                "sense_id": "f67c9ca0-3686-3e7c-b9ef-0a0ad516e133",
                                                "text": "The Young Collector's Handbook. By E. C. R. Hadfield and C. Hamilton Ellis. London: Oxford University Press, Amen House, E.C.4. 7½ in. × 5 in. × 1 in. 78 pp. Illustrated. Price 4s. 6d. net.—Most persons are collectors at some periods of their lives. Some outgrow the habit; with others it becomes a mania; and with still others it is a lasting habit intelligently planned as one aspect of a study of a particular subject."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ed94108-e9a5-48ce-831e-ddefb191be00",
                                                "sense_id": "f67c9ca0-3686-3e7c-b9ef-0a0ad516e133",
                                                "text": "Hungry for fame and the approval of rare-animal collector Queen Victoria (Imelda Staunton), Darwin deceives the Captain and his crew into believing they can get enough booty to win the pirate competition by entering Polly in a science fair. So the pirates journey to London in cheerful, blinkered defiance of the Queen, a hotheaded schemer whose royal crest reads simply “I hate pirates.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c40bfba-7777-3fe3-8f40-0310791417b6",
                                        "entry_id": "89674fca-284a-38d1-92e9-ee07bc695211",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who is employed to collect payments."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc3c5ecc-ce24-447c-b7a0-672d9b12da7d",
                                                "sense_id": "7c40bfba-7777-3fe3-8f40-0310791417b6",
                                                "text": "She works for the government as a tax collector."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8278db6-a601-440f-a1d5-f0364dc66b5d",
                                                "sense_id": "7c40bfba-7777-3fe3-8f40-0310791417b6",
                                                "text": "Andrew Houſtoun and Adam Muſhet, being Tackſmen of the Excize, did Imploy Thomas Rue to be their Collector, and gave him a Sallary of 30. pound Sterling for a year."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "300a2cda-88be-4190-a544-9d4ddc2bb1e7",
                                                "sense_id": "7c40bfba-7777-3fe3-8f40-0310791417b6",
                                                "text": "I should've left my phone at home 'cause this is a disaster / Callin' like a collector / Sorry, I cannot answer"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0305f661-8c20-354f-b5cd-1b951eaf992b",
                                        "entry_id": "89674fca-284a-38d1-92e9-ee07bc695211",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who is employed to collect payments.",
                                            "A mafioso whose task is to collect protection money from small businesses"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f821e478-93ba-32a2-8f85-9272a9d87bf6",
                                        "entry_id": "89674fca-284a-38d1-92e9-ee07bc695211",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The amplified terminal on a bipolar junction transistor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8970257b-5aab-383e-b8b5-10f1ecdbd621",
                                        "entry_id": "89674fca-284a-38d1-92e9-ee07bc695211",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A compiler of books; one who collects scattered passages and puts them together in one book."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c6dc05d-7b8a-494b-8672-d96e83b27988",
                                                "sense_id": "8970257b-5aab-383e-b8b5-10f1ecdbd621",
                                                "text": "Volumes[…] without any of tthe collector's own reflections."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ca152c8-940d-3596-bae4-865244ac9c64",
                                        "entry_id": "89674fca-284a-38d1-92e9-ee07bc695211",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One holding a Bachelor of Arts in Oxford, formerly appointed to superintend some scholastic proceedings in Lent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1441acc9-74c0-482c-a437-98600994f0af",
                                                "sense_id": "4ca152c8-940d-3596-bae4-865244ac9c64",
                                                "text": "Whereupon he soon after appointed A. W. his collector in Austins; which office he kept till he was admitted Mr. of arts"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ce8824a3-05e4-3c92-91d7-311d01070dc3",
                                        "entry_id": "89674fca-284a-38d1-92e9-ee07bc695211",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A major sewer which collects sewerage from a number of smaller branch sewers"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bfab4be0-21b4-4f6d-b70d-16ef879ada28",
                        "source_entry_id": "2ae15cc2-7a4e-3e43-ac9d-87048c0bb642",
                        "source_sense_description": "геол.",
                        "target_lang_word": "de colector",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4d04dd71-ba90-425f-a417-a5764f16f7c0",
                        "source_entry_id": "2ae15cc2-7a4e-3e43-ac9d-87048c0bb642",
                        "source_sense_description": "собирающий долги",
                        "target_lang_word": "collection",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "collection",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6ba8fd29-9d45-3eda-8b48-5d4972b39e5f",
                                        "entry_id": "01657fee-51e4-3863-b8f5-11aeaca27ce6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A set of items or amount of material procured, gathered or presented together."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "930830be-7592-4b27-ad7c-83b711501bf7",
                                                "sense_id": "6ba8fd29-9d45-3eda-8b48-5d4972b39e5f",
                                                "text": "The attic contains a remarkable collection of antiques, oddities, and random junk."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdf0842c-04e9-46f4-936f-22a905183fa5",
                                                "sense_id": "6ba8fd29-9d45-3eda-8b48-5d4972b39e5f",
                                                "text": "The asteroid belt consists of a collection of dust, rubble, and minor planets."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee03fd50-3c02-456f-896a-f006272e0aae",
                                                "sense_id": "6ba8fd29-9d45-3eda-8b48-5d4972b39e5f",
                                                "text": "This year's Summer Collection will include a wide range of evening wear."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c118d158-7d3e-462d-9e9a-1596d4607645",
                                                "sense_id": "6ba8fd29-9d45-3eda-8b48-5d4972b39e5f",
                                                "text": "He has a big collection of stamps."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "21bb0f60-a99e-4a83-b2b4-cb1a10940303",
                                                "sense_id": "6ba8fd29-9d45-3eda-8b48-5d4972b39e5f",
                                                "text": "He has a superb coin collection."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e783e06c-ccdd-4bdb-8d85-1d72dfcc2490",
                                                "sense_id": "6ba8fd29-9d45-3eda-8b48-5d4972b39e5f",
                                                "text": "Secondly, I continue to base my concepts on intensive study of a limited suite of collections, rather than superficial study of every packet that comes to hand."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cdc2ce49-0b3c-4827-b2b3-57dfe3381b28",
                                                "sense_id": "6ba8fd29-9d45-3eda-8b48-5d4972b39e5f",
                                                "text": "collections of moisture"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da8c0e21-3a20-4c1d-b8a4-242c4a72d82b",
                                                "sense_id": "6ba8fd29-9d45-3eda-8b48-5d4972b39e5f",
                                                "text": "a purulent collection"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97457347-f340-4a16-8a03-438c6ad7770d",
                                                "sense_id": "6ba8fd29-9d45-3eda-8b48-5d4972b39e5f",
                                                "text": "Of all the queer collections of humans outside of a crazy asylum, it seemed to me this sanitarium was the cup winner. […] When you're well enough off so's you don't have to fret about anything but your heft or your diseases you begin to get queer, I suppose."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "be280f98-4598-3b11-98b6-497c0a6e1297",
                                        "entry_id": "01657fee-51e4-3863-b8f5-11aeaca27ce6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A set of pitch classes used by a composer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96996b87-4b35-4748-8477-6ca8dd05aaa9",
                                                "sense_id": "be280f98-4598-3b11-98b6-497c0a6e1297",
                                                "text": "The \"collectional information\" one receives is ambiguous since the collection { C, E, F, G, A } occurs in the key of C and in the key of F."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e6534e8-c95c-468f-ab39-c630e20224d0",
                                                "sense_id": "be280f98-4598-3b11-98b6-497c0a6e1297",
                                                "text": "In fact, students are often taught that specific collections—diatonic, octatonic, and whole-tone, etc.—typify these composers' compositional language."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ace9cd0b-9241-4396-872a-df9435e97f07",
                                                "sense_id": "be280f98-4598-3b11-98b6-497c0a6e1297",
                                                "text": "Simply put, the realm of available collections in a largely diatonic environment is much smaller than it is in truly atonal one."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "56b3902c-83c3-32d5-9d11-4c2c44470467",
                                        "entry_id": "01657fee-51e4-3863-b8f5-11aeaca27ce6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The activity of collecting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
